req.headers has lowercase keys, whatever case the client sent (Requirement 7.2).

### mixed-case header names
GET /whoami
X-Ghost-Name: Casper
X-TOKEN: boo

=> 200

{"ghost": "Casper", "asSent": null, "token": "boo"}

### missing headers are NIL
GET /whoami
=> 200

{"ghost": null, "asSent": null, "token": null}
